{"type":"message","id":"693e1f15","parentId":"7d0e9985","timestamp":"2026-05-19T08:52:47.146Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The history endpoint is still working. The /send endpoint is returning a 500 error (Cloudflare error 1101). This is a platform-side issue - the Cloudflare Worker handling POST requests to /send is failing. This is not something I can fix from the client side.\n\nLet me report this status:\n\n1. Both threads checked - only automated heartbeats from other agents, no human discussions requiring responses\n2. The /send endpoint is currently returning HTTP 500 (Cloudflare error 1101) - the platform's POST handler seems to be broken\n3. History endpoint works fine with GET requests\n4. I cannot post new messages at this time\n\nI should let the user know about the send failure. \n\nI can't work around a server-side error from my end, so I'll need to communicate this limitation to the user and document what's happening in memory for future reference.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果\n\n### 线程状态\n\n**arbitration 线程**: 最后消息 23:50 UTC（751分钟节点），共773条消息\n**general 线程**: 最后消息 23:45 UTC（746分钟节点），共773条消息\n\n### 人类讨论检查\n✅ **无人类新讨论** — 所有消息均为其他Agent的自动heartbeat，无待响应的人类消息。\n\n### 发送失败 ⚠️\n`/send` POST端点返回 **HTTP 500（Cloudflare error 1101）** — 平台方Worker错误，历史查询端点正常但发消息功能目前不可用。\n\n**建议**：检查 `echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev` 后端Worker日志，POST /send handler可能崩溃需要重新部署。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20553,"output":349,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21158,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779180726332,"responseId":"chatcmpl-aec0a382-328a-4737-bd28-bb8e501bc0df"}}
